    {
      "id": "dd2017d",
      "type": "text",
      "settings": {
        "html": "<h2>Ordering ahead</h2><p>Call <a href=\"tel:5550142290\">(555) 014-2290</a> or email <a href=\"mailto:hello@crumbandco.example\">hello@crumbandco.example</a> by 5 p.m. and we’ll set your order aside for the next morning. Tell us your name, what you’d like and roughly when you’ll come by.</p><p>Whole cakes, tarts and orders of more than a dozen pastries need three days’ notice. We hold orders until 1 p.m.</p><h3>Allergies</h3><p>Everything is baked in one small kitchen with wheat, dairy, eggs and nuts, so we can’t promise anything is free of them. Ask us; we’ll tell you exactly what’s in it.</p>",
        "width": "narrow",
        "align": "left",
        "background": "paper",
        "anchor": "order"
      }
